  "physical": {
    "title": "Unknown. Designs for male and female fancy dress costume, possibly based on Russian, Turkish or Ottoman historic costume. French, c.1840s. Fashion plate, cropped down, showing a man and woman in fancy dress costume probably based on Russian, Ottoman or Turkish historic dress. The man in a red turban and doublet with voluminious brown pantaloons tucked into knee boots and a purple mantle; the woman in a yellow brocade tunic and blue petticoat and sash with a kokoshnik style headdress, holding a masquerade mask in one hand.  ",
